UID:a0140fa9f0d8cfe8c97a42906144@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:“YOU MIGHT PASTE YOURSELF IN DESIRE TO CONTEMPLATE” There 
 are events that only happen when nothing happens. When we contemplate\, we
  stand up for our humanity. When we pause\, we perform an artistic act. Wh
 en we interrupt\, we witness wonder. Contemplating Silence suggests someth
 ing extraordinary in its premise: actor Lluís Homar\, under the direction
  of Luis d’Ors\, brings to the stage Biography of Silence \, the essay b
 y Pablo d’Ors that transformed meditation into an unexpected publishing 
 phenomenon. On stage\, a materialization of silent contemplation\, a stagi
 ng of suspension itself. Quite literally\, something never before seen or 
 heard. There is a deep curiosity to experience it. Following the\nCategory
 : Multidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/s
 chedule/pablo-dors-biography-silence-lluis-homar
LOCATION:Naves Matadero\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/pablo-dors-biography-silenc
 e-lluis-homar
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
