CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:Theme On this occasion\, Wikiesfera\, in collaboration with Me
 dialab Matadero\, invites you to participate in an edit-a-thon aimed at pu
 blishing Wikipedia articles about women journalists and communicators. To 
 introduce the topic\, we will feature journalist and historian Carolina Pe
 charromán de la Cruz. Associated with Televisión Española (TVE) for ove
 r thirty years\, she has served as Equality Editor for TVE News Services a
 nd coordinator of the RTVE Igualdad platform since 2020. Between 2021 and 
 2026\, she directed and presented the show Objetivo Igualdad \, which rece
 ived numerous awards for promoting true gender equality and fighting gende
 r-based violence. In this session\, Carolina will speak t\nCategory: Multi
 disciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule
 /women-against-disinformation-edit-thon-carolina-pecharroman
LOCATION:Nave 17. Terrario\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
